<title>UK: LB SAAR sets 200 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB SAAR sets 200 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SAAR</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    18.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT/MUN   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
